{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Ear, eye, Lord</b> — (verses 12–14) three connected things. That is: the ear to hear reproof and the eye to see rebuke HaShem made; therefore do not love sleep, for the eye was not created to sleep except a set time, and after that to see and to choose the ways of discipline."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :register {:flags {0 ["Lord"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:48.914313088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}